eted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.3.stable, v4.4.dev6 [1f47e4c4e]\n- Not reproducible in: v4.2.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono - Windows 10.0.19045 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6603) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-7700K CPU @ 4.20GHz (8 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nSetting `Update on Text Changed` to true prevents decimals from being input. It seems to be similar to what happened with #81989. You can copy and paste decimal numbers into the SpinBox just fine, but trying to type a decimal will do nothing. Changing `step` to a decimal value < 1 still doesn't allow a decimal to be typed. This is true for both GDscript and C# in 4.3 & 4.4-dev6, but not in 4.2 (as #81989 fixed it in that version)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new scene\n2. Add a SpinBox node\n3. Set `Update on Text Changed` to true\n4. Run the current scene\n5. Type decimal (.) into the SpinBox\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5d72dd2-0f75-4404-b0cc-b51aa0d23769)\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.gi